[0.030469, "o", "╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n║  FAAR · Failure-Aware Agentic Recovery for OCR-RAG                               ║\r\n║  Text-first retrieval → quality gate → typed recovery ONLY when signals fire     ║\r\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mStep 1 · Four real questions over OCR documents (offline, deterministic)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  embeddings  : local-hash-v1   (no model download, no GPU)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  VLM backend : mock            (no API cost)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  seed        : 42\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mStep 2 · Run the end-to-end pipeline via the faar-demo CLI\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  example 1"]
