[6.612212, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m============================================================================================\r\n= FAAR · FAILURE-AWARE AGENTIC RECOVERY FOR OCR-RAG                                        =\r\n============================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.612308, "o", "A document-QA research pipeline that retrieves text-first, then spends on typed recovery\r\n(semantic retry · word-level OCR correction · structural/visual fallback) ONLY when quality\r\nsignals say the evidence is unreliable.\r\n\r\n  embeddings : local-hash-v1  (deterministic, no model download)\r\n  VLM backend: mock  (offline, no API cost)\r\n  seed       : 42  ·  python 3.12.13\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m····························································································\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m============================================================================================\r\n= 446d159e  ·  manual/dgx_a100  p.27                                                       =\r\n============================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mQUESTION   \u001b[0m \u001b[0mIs it mandatory for the NVIDIA partner network personnel or NVIDIA field service engineers to install the DGX A100 System?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.612343, "o", "  \u001b[1mGROUND TRUTH\u001b[0m \u001b[0mYes\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mANSWER     \u001b[0m \u001b[32mYes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.61243, "o", "  \u001b[1mEVIDENCE   \u001b[0m QUICK START AND BASIC OPERATION This chapter provides basic requirements and\r\n              instructions for using the DGX A100 System, including how to perform a preliminary\r\n              health check and how to prepare for running containers. Be sure to visit the DGX\r\n              documentation website at https:// docs.nvidia.com/dgx/ for additional product\r\n              documentation. 4.1. I …\r\n\u001b[2m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m1 RETRIEVE \u001b[0m \u001b[0mtext-first hybrid (BM25 + local-hash dense)  ·  local-hash-v1 backend\u001b[0m\r\n              top hit fused 0.457  ·  lexical 0.00  ·  dense 1.00\r\n  \u001b[1m2 GATE\u001b[0m      quality 0.637  ·  OCR corruption 0.050  ·  layout alerts 0\r\n"]
[6.612484, "o", "             \u001b[31mFAIL\u001b[0m lexical (BM25) evidence too weak to trust — do not trust a direct answer\r\n  \u001b[1m3 DIAGNOSE\u001b[0m  failure type = \u001b[36msemantic\u001b[0m  →  \u001b[1m\u001b[36msemantic recovery — re-query with context-anchored evidence\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m4 RETRY    \u001b[0m re-query: Is it mandatory for the NVIDIA partner network personnel or NVIDIA field\r\n              service engineers to install the DGX A100 System? QUICK START AND BASIC OPERATION This\r\n              chapter provides basic requirements and instructions for using the DGX A100 System,\r\n              including how to perform a preliminary\r\n              outcome: retry_retrieval · succeeded · semantic_backtrack_query_executed\r\n  \u001b[1m5 ANSWER\u001b[0m     Yes  (yes_no_inference, support 15)\r\n"]
[6.612518, "o", "  \u001b[1mCOST\u001b[0m       multimodal tokens: \u001b[32m0  (text-only pipeline)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m============================================================================================\r\n= 1dc1d806  ·  law/Array BioPharma Inc. - LICENSE, DEVELOPMENT AND COMMERCIALIZATION AGREEMENT  p.93=\r\n============================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mQUESTION   \u001b[0m \u001b[0mWhat is the time frame within which Senior Executives must resolve a dispute after written notice is given?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mGROUND TRUTH\u001b[0m \u001b[0mforty-five (45) days\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mANSWER     \u001b[0m \u001b[32mforty-five (45) days\u001b[0m\r\n"]
