[6.613058, "o", "  \u001b[1mREAD       \u001b[0m A naive always-on visual pipeline sends every page image to a VLM and pays multimodal\r\n              cost on every question. FAAR retrieves text-first and only routes to visual (or word-\r\n              level / semantic) recovery when the quality gate reports a specific failure — so clean\r\n              questions cost nothing, and difficult OCR questions pay only for the recovery they\r\n              actually need.\r\n\r\n"]
[6.616258, "o", "\u001b[36mDemo complete. Run logs kept for inspection:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
